'''EB-3''' was a [[SP-4 analysis droid|SP-4 unit]] in [[Taborr's gang]].<ref name="YJA" />

==Biography==
===Raid on Hap's Sap Tap===
EB-3 was a member of a [[pirate]] [[Taborr's gang|gang]] led by [[Cyrus Vuundir|Taborr Val-Dorn]]. Alongside Val Dorn and the [[Gamorrean]] [[Pord]], the droid participated in several raids on [[Hap's Sap Tap]], a [[Cafe|café]] on [[Tenoo]]. During [[Raid on Hap's Sap Tap|one]] of these raids, the pirates were interrupted by [[Jedi Initiate|Jedi younglings]] [[Kai Brightstar]], [[Lys Solay]] and [[Nubs]], who told them to return their loot. Val Dorn ordered EB-3 and Pord to take the cart with their stolen goods to their [[Iron Talon|starship]], but they were quickly overpowered by the Jedi. Val Dorn managed to distract the Jedi, allowing the pirates to escape, but the Jedi managed to retrieve the loot with the help of [[Nash Durango]] and several other locals, forcing the gang to leave empty-handed.<ref name="The Young Jedi">{{YJA|The Young Jedi}}</ref>

{{Droid-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
EB-3 first appeared in the fifth animated short "[[Nash's Firehawk Frenzy]]," which aired on [[April 17]], [[2023]],<ref name="Firehawk Frenzy">{{SWKidsYouTube|series=Star Wars: Young Jedi Adventures|text=Short 5: Nash's Firehawk Frenzy|video=vGRtUu7K4Dc}}</ref> prior to the premiere of the [[Young Jedi Adventures Season One|first season]] of the [[Disney+]] animated series ''[[Star Wars: Young Jedi Adventures]]''.<ref name="The Young Jedi">{{YJA|The Young Jedi}}</ref> This droid was designed by [[India Boeckh]]<ref name="Design">{{WebCite|url=https://indiaboeckh.com/young-jedi-adventures|text=Young Jedi Adventures|work=[[India Boeckh]]'s [https://indiaboeckh.com official website]|archivedate=20241218074404}}</ref> and modeled by Gabriel Lopez.<ref>{{ArtStation|url=artwork/Xg2rgl|username=gabelopez|name=[[Gabriel Lopez]]|text=Star Wars Young Jedi Adventures – Droids 2}}</ref>

